guide completionist-alliance/attune-compound-key-a
title Krol'dok Compound Key (Krol'dok Stronghold key)
faction Alliance
levels 41-41
category Dungeons
folder Completionist attunements and keys
zone Riverglades
pitch Krol'dok Compound Key: Opens the way into the upper area of Krol'dok Stronghold. Tunk, by the smithy near War Handler Ashka, drops the Krol'dok Moulding; Alphonse Dumas in Farholde Keep forges the key from it with 4 Thick Leather and 12 Iron Bars.
why Opens the way into the upper area of Krol'dok Stronghold. Tunk, by the smithy near War Handler Ashka, drops the Krol'dok Moulding; Alphonse Dumas in Farholde Keep forges the key from it with 4 Thick Leather and 12 Iron Bars.



# Written in: quests the drafter could not route and the route does not pass. Each is taken once what it follows is handed in.

